  "id": 347,
  "description": "## 💀 Forgotten Watch💀\n\n### Discord is mandatory to join the guild\n \n**Newbie friendly** subsidiary of **Forgotten** \n(https://web.idle-mmo.com/guilds?guild_id=113)\n\nWe offer an active leadership and plan on being around for a long time. If you&#039;re an active player looking for a fair guild to progress with we&#039;d love to have you! This is a med-level guild subsidiary of Forgotten.\n \n### ✨ Features\n- Active main guild\n- Selfmade world boss timer via discord\n- Guild armory\n \n### ✔️ Requirements\n- **92 Minimum combat level** (No alts please)\n- Participate in the raid (Preferably daily)\n- Be active. Inactivity over 3d will result in a kick (Unless you let us know through Discord)\n- Help fulfill guild challenges for 2 daily raids \n \n### 📅 Raid Schedule\n- **17:00 PM CET** (Lvl 92 raid)\n- **19:00 PM CET** (Lvl 92 raid)\n- Both raids DYNAMIC to accommodate Citadel WBs\n \n ### 💬 Discord\n- Join our discord server to apply, get news &amp; information and chat with us: https://discord.gg/kCKdJmckxC\n\n ### 🏰 Other Forgotten Guilds\n- Forgotten CL 100+\n- Forgotten Vanguard CL 80 - 91\n- Forgotten Dawn CL 60 - 79\n- Forgotten Order CL 40- 59\n- Forgotten Tavern (POOL GUILD)\n\n**Welcome to the Forgotten.**\nWe are recruiting! Simply apply to a Forgotten guild within your CL, if no spot is available apply in a lower level subsidiary.",
